# PRIMARY ROOT SYMBOLS
# --------------------

Symbol: √
Name: Square Root
Unicode: U+221A
HTML Entity: &radic;
Category: Mathematics - Root
Usage: Primary root symbol for system activation

Symbol: ∛
Name: Cube Root
Unicode: U+221B
HTML Entity: &#8731;
Category: Mathematics - Root
Usage: Third degree root

Symbol: ∜
Name: Fourth Root
Unicode: U+221C
HTML Entity: &#8732;
Category: Mathematics - Root
Usage: Fourth degree root

